OL,3,GNEWSAGirl asks council to 'fight' in
OL,4,Adata centre row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nine-year-old girl has told
OL,7,Fcouncillors to "fight for our homes,
OL,8,Fcommunity and landscape" in a row over
OL,9,Fplans for a giant data centre and
OL,10,Fbattery energy storage site in the
OL,11,Fcountryside.
OL,13,FDeveloper Xlinks wants to build the
OL,14,F1.5Gw AI data centre - which would be
OL,15,Fone of the biggest in Europe - near
OL,16,FTorrington in north Devon in a Unesco
OL,17,Fbiosphere.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
