OL,3,GNEWSAGirl asks council to 'fight' in
OL,4,Adata centre row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plans were first made public in
OL,7,FJune but local residents have used
OL,8,FFreedom of Information requests to
OL,9,Freveal the developer had been in
OL,10,Fdiscussions with Torridge District
OL,11,FCouncil officials since March 2025.
OL,13,FThe council said it was "standard
OL,14,Fpractice for an organisation to consult
OL,15,Fwith the local planning department" and
OL,16,Fno plans had yet been submitted.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
